'''Theatre (5-Scale) Speed-Runner''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Theatre of Blood]] in a team of 5 players in less than 14 minutes and 15 seconds.

Unlike [[Tombs of Amascut]], speed-based achievements for the Theatre of Blood count the challenge time rather than the overall time.

Like other tasks requiring a specific number of players, this combat achievement is not required for [[Group Ironman Mode|Group Ironmen]] with a smaller group size.

